","position":29,"rental_id":250119,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:11:06.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:11:06.000000Z"},{"id":4916262,"path":"https://res-2.cloudinary.com/bookingsync/image/upload/c_fill,f_auto,fl_progressive,g_center,h_1600,q_auto,w_2400/v1760869190/5czr_e4f5d4fe-e97c-43d3-a47a-8540fb2370ab.jpg?_a=BACMTiGT","position":30,"rental_id":250119,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:11:06.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:11:06.000000Z"},{"id":4916290,"path":"https://res-4.cloudinary.com/bookingsync/image/upload/c_fill,f_auto,fl_progressive,g_center,h_1600,q_auto,w_2400/v1760869357/5czr_47322aca-913d-40a9-a75d-9a85ff600946.jpg?_a=BACMTiGT","position":31,"rental_id":250119,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:11:06.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:11:06.000000Z"}],"image":{"id":4916267,"path":"https://res-1.cloudinary.com/bookingsync/image/upload/c_fill,f_auto,fl_progressive,g_center,h_1600,q_auto,w_2400/v1760869233/5czr_e107e519-651e-43f5-ac3d-2df4d0c77271.jpg?_a=BACMTiGT","position":1,"rental_id":250119,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:11:06.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:11:06.000000Z"},"reviews":[{"id":5850265,"review":"Séjour exceptionnel à El gouna ! L’hôte a été d’une gentillesse et d’une disponibilité incroyables, toujours à l’écoute et très réactif. L’appartement est parfaitement conforme aux photos, propre, calme et idéalement situé. J’ai particulièrement apprécié l’accueil chaleureux et les petites attentions à l’arrivée. Je recommande à 100 % et reviendrai sans hésiter lors de mon prochain séjour à Hurghada. Merci encore pour tout !","rental_id":250119,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:48.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:48.000000Z"},{"id":5857455,"review":"Tolle erholsame Unterkunft. Sehr sauber, sehr ruhig. Hier kann man relaxen. Es war sehr gemütlich. Service jederzeit vorhanden und hat alles reibungslos geklappt. Vielen Dank !","rental_id":250119,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:51.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:51.000000Z"},{"id":5868355,"review":"Great place to stay within El Gouna …","rental_id":250119,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:53.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:53.000000Z"},{"id":5885998,"review":"Positive:\nclean and comfort\n\nNegative:\nfar from centre","rental_id":250119,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:55.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:55.000000Z"},{"id":5901229,"review":"We had a great stay in January. The place was very clean, well equipped, and everything was exactly as described. The host was very responsive and helpful, which made the stay even better.\n\n\tThe only small point to note is that the exact location and directions could be shared more clearly in advance, as the property is accessed through a construction area. We would also recommend having your own car when booking this property at the moment (infrastructure might improve in near future).\n\n\tOther than that, everything was perfect and we really enjoyed our stay. Highly recommended.","rental_id":250119,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:01.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:01.000000Z"},{"id":5909767,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":250119,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:03.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:03.000000Z"},{"id":5909999,"review":"A clean and private place that fully met my expectations. The experience was smooth overall, and responses were always quick and helpful, which made everything easy and comfortable.","rental_id":250119,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:03.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:03.000000Z"},{"id":5917339,"review":"Positive:\nTrès belle villa spacieuse avec sa piscine privée.\n\nNegative:\nLa localisation.","rental_id":250119,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:06.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:06.000000Z"},{"id":5930097,"review":"Positive:\nThe place was amazing and very clean. The area us beautiful so dont be scared to explore the al gouna. Also there are taxis who works within the city because this villa is far and work is being made around. I would recommend to hire a car for easy access. The pool was cold but we swam anyway didnt stop us. The people in charge was so helpful and answered all my questions quickly.\n\nNegative:\nThe location but they had taxis within al gouna so contact them and they will come pick you up. They even have tuktuk which is cheaper and quicker to get around","rental_id":250119,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:10.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:10.000000Z"},{"id":5958997,"review":"Amazing home, very helpful host, not my first time with them and would definitely visit again.","rental_id":250119,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:13.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:13.000000Z"},{"id":6023935,"review":"This was honestly one of the worst Airbnb experiences I’ve had. This place is massively over priced for it actually offers!\nThe appartement was far from clean—dust everywhere & not cleaned furniture, and the pool was in terrible condition.\nit’s clear that no proper cleaning nor safety standards are being followed. \nWhat made it even worse is that I ended up wasting almost a day and a half of my stay dealing with cleaning. I had to stay with the cleaning company myself just to reach a basic acceptable level . \nThis was completely unacceptable, you’re supposed to arrive to a clean space, not lose your time and money fixing it yourself.\n\nThe location is extremely impractical. It’s very far from downtown and anything you’d actually want to access, which completely defeats the purpose of staying in Gouna. \n\nOn top of that, the entire compound is still under construction. There is constant noise, & dust is everywhere no matter what you do, which makes it impossible to relax or enjoy ur stay.","rental_id":250119,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:17.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:17.000000Z"},{"id":6103818,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nIts marketed as a villa but the truth is its 2 appartments with separate entrances. \nThe pool has not been cleaned since long time which lead to unclear water. \nThe entire place was dusty and dirty\nThere is no signal and no WiFi in the bedroom downstairs. \nThe management is the worst ive dealt with. They dont answer when they are needed. After checking in I tried contacting as the unit was dirty and not clean they promised they would send the housekeeping team the next day and I waited patiently but no one showed up.\nThe information provided with WiFi network was wrong. Truly disappointing service.","rental_id":250119,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:27.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:27.000000Z"},{"id":6114033,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":250119,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:30.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:30.000000Z"},{"id":6168975,"review":"On a passer un très bon séjour, le logement est pratique beaucoup de rangement ,petit + pour les dresssing niveau déco rien à dire. Salle de bain un peu salle sur le sol. Et point négatif pour le sable qui est présent mais l’hôte ne peut rien y faire je pense. Hôte super réactif et très aimable. Je vous recommande le logement un 10/10.","rental_id":250119,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:40.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:40.000000Z"}],"amenities":[]}